{
 "total": 65.398,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "scene": "open",
   "text": "He ordered 38 soldiers to cross a bridge like they'd just left a tavern.",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 3.586
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "scene": "parade",
   "text": "You see, it's 1831,",
   "start": 3.736,
   "end": 5.338
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "parade",
   "text": "and his regiment has spent months learning to march in perfect step.",
   "start": 5.386,
   "end": 8.126
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "boots",
   "text": "Left, right, left.",
   "start": 8.198,
   "end": 9.275
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "boots",
   "text": "Every boot hitting the ground at the exact same moment.",
   "start": 9.335,
   "end": 11.425
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "general",
   "text": "It's the pride of the army.",
   "start": 11.485,
   "end": 12.541
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "break",
   "text": "So when the captain yells \"Break step!\"",
   "start": 12.691,
   "end": 14.433
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "bridge",
   "text": "right in front of a brand-new chain bridge,",
   "start": 14.463,
   "end": 16.262
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "ducks",
   "text": "his men stumble across like a herd of confused ducks.",
   "start": 16.292,
   "end": 18.73
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "rival",
   "text": "On the far bank, a rival captain is laughing.",
   "start": 18.88,
   "end": 21.051
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "rival",
   "text": "\"Lovely. Should we fetch them some walking sticks?\"",
   "start": 21.123,
   "end": 23.078
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "weird",
   "text": "But it gets weirder.",
   "start": 23.258,
   "end": 23.989
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "tiptoe",
   "text": "The captain makes his men cross one at a time. Ten feet apart. On tiptoe.",
   "start": 24.049,
   "end": 27.7
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "march",
   "text": "Meanwhile, the rival lines up 74 men,",
   "start": 27.85,
   "end": 30.079
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "march",
   "text": "shoulders back, chins up,",
   "start": 30.109,
   "end": 31.455
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "march",
   "text": "and marches them onto the bridge in flawless rhythm.",
   "start": 31.485,
   "end": 33.506
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "scene": "thump",
   "text": "",
   "start": 33.626,
   "end": 33.626
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "scene": "hum",
   "text": "Then the bridge starts to hum.",
   "start": 35.526,
   "end": 36.721
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "scene": "hum",
   "text": "A tiny wobble. Then a bigger one.",
   "start": 36.793,
   "end": 38.434
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "scene": "xray",
   "text": "The chains swing closer and closer to the beat of the boots.",
   "start": 38.506,
   "end": 41.161
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "scene": "what",
   "text": "Wait, what?",
   "start": 41.341,
   "end": 42.073
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "scene": "string",
   "text": "You see, every bridge has its own natural bounce, like a guitar string.",
   "start": 42.283,
   "end": 45.359
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "scene": "swing",
   "text": "Ever pushed a kid on a swing?",
   "start": 45.449,
   "end": 46.587
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "scene": "swing",
   "text": "Little pushes, at just the right moment, and they fly higher and higher.",
   "start": 46.647,
   "end": 49.468
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "scene": "pushes",
   "text": "74 soldiers stomping in sync are 74 perfectly timed pushes.",
   "start": 49.558,
   "end": 52.902
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "scene": "snap",
   "text": "A bolt snaps. The deck tilts.",
   "start": 53.082,
   "end": 54.711
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "scene": "river",
   "text": "And 74 very proud soldiers slide straight into the river.",
   "start": 54.771,
   "end": 57.407
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "scene": "river",
   "text": "Still in step.",
   "start": 57.497,
   "end": 58.205
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "scene": "rules",
   "text": "Soon after, the army changed the rules. Every soldier breaks step on a bridge.",
   "start": 58.415,
   "end": 61.914
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "scene": "fire",
   "text": "And the rival captain? He spent a week drying his boots, his uniform and his",
   "start": 62.004,
   "end": 65.398
  }
 ],
